<instruction role="digest">
Summarize the test failure above for an engineer who will fix it, as JSON.

- `summary`: what failed and the most likely cause, in at most five sentences.
- `failure_class`: the single best class from the allowed values.
- `key_failures`: up to five failing tests with the essential error line for each.
- `suspected_locations`: up to five code locations (path, line, function) most likely at fault.
Do not propose a fix.
</instruction>
